 "pricingMd": "# Pricing\n\n## Video\n\nPrices per second of video. The rate depends on resolution and audio, so each row runs from the cheapest setting to the most expensive one. Get the exact price for a job from [`POST /video/quote`](https://docs.venice.ai/api-reference/endpoint/video/quote) before you queue it; each model's page lists clip prices. Models priced by source charge by the video you send, so quote them with your input.\n\n| Model | ID | Type | Per second | Privacy |\n| - | - | - | - | - |\n| Flux 3 Extend | `flux-3-extend-video` | Video edit | Priced by source | Anonymized |\n| Seedance 2.5 Edit | `seedance-2-5-edit-video-basic` | Video edit | Quote per job | Anonymized |\n| Wan 3.0 | `wan-3-0-text-to-video` | Text to video | $0.065 to $0.26 | Anonymized |\n\n\n## Web search and tools\n",
